<title>UK: Halifax average price at tender 731p/shr.</title>
<headline>Halifax average price at tender 731p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Halifax Plc said on Friday that the average price of bids in a daily tender held on Thursday was 731 pence a share.</p>
<p>Halifax had orders to sell 7.58 million shares, representing around 0.3 percent of the company's share capial.</p>
<p>Britain's biggest mortgage lender made its debut on Monday on the London stock market.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
